AirSpace contracts

This repository is a fork of the Solana Foundation escrow program,
https://github.com/solana-foundation/escrow, taken at commit
36187ad52c7c03d11b13b6f1da9461f2f757cee2. That commit is the one that the upstream
audit covers.

The upstream code is licensed under the MIT license, and its copyright notice is kept
in LICENSE. The changes that AirSpace made to it, and the code that AirSpace added,
are copyright AirSpace and licensed under the same MIT license.

AirSpace changed the upstream program as listed in README.md: the Codama code
generation was removed, a settlement extension and the instructions SetSettlement,
Refund, and Settle were added, and Deposit and Withdraw got one new check each.
